# Baseline count of dangling [[wiki-links]] per memory home, for scripts/memory-canary.
#
# Format: <home dir name>=<count>, one line per home; `#` starts a comment. The name is
# the memory home's last path component (webapp for identities/<you>/claude/memory/webapp).
#
# At or below the number = WARN (inherited rot, visible but not blocking).
# ABOVE it = PROBLEM, which fails --strict and blocks the pre-push hook, so a
# promotion or a human adding a NEW dangle is caught immediately.
# A home with no line has no ratchet: its dangles are warnings only.
#
# Start a home at its current count (memory-canary --dir <home> prints it), then
# ratchet DOWN only: fix rot, then lower the number. Never raise it to silence a
# real regression.
#
# webapp=0
# dotfiles=3
